{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12107400","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210740001:0":{"text":"소니아, 이 물귀신들이 항복하는데, 어떻게 할까요?","source_cn":"索尼娅，这帮水鬼要投降，我们接下来怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49ECD0F792CBEDBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210740002:0":{"text":"체인호를 접수해!","source_cn":"夺取枷锁号！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099E6A45A3CD5CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210740003:0":{"text":"오오, 배를 접수한다고? 잘 됐다! 내가 딱 맞게 왔나 봐.","source_cn":"——嘿，我听到你们说要夺船？正好！看来我没错过什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75811FA8BBA1473D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210740004:1":{"text":"신밧드, 왔어요? 테시오는요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你来了？泰西欧呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DDACB708A06B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210740005:0":{"text":"묶어서 선실에 던져놨어. 블러디 로즈의 형제들이 보고 있으니 걱정하지 마. “특별한 대우”를 해줬으니, 죽진 않을 거야.","source_cn":"绑好了，丢在船舱里，血薇帮的弟兄们看着呢。别担心，给了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F92786F649F9724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210740006:0":{"text":"누님, 형제들이 표적을 보고 배를 찾아왔어요. 체인호는 이미 우리가 완전히 장악했고, 말 안 듣는 물귀신은 물에 던져 상어 밥으로 주었습니다.","source_cn":"大姐头，兄弟们跟着你留下的记号上船了。现在，枷锁号已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B44E944C3697B88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210740007:0":{"text":"사람을 보내 루카에게 파티 준비를 하라고 소식을 전해줘. 나머지는 전리품을 챙기고, 문제없으면 돌아가자.","source_cn":"派个人回去给卢卡送信，让他准备庆功宴。其余人清点一下战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54ADDF43D48115F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210740008:1":{"text":"좋아요! 체인호를 몰고 돌아가요!","source_cn":"好耶！开枷锁号回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x250CD20BFF43D440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210740009:1":{"text":"그럼 내가 키를 잡을까? 어떻게 가는지 알아.","source_cn":"要让我来掌舵吗？我知道怎么回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27A353D9777CB316","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210740010:0":{"text":"그럼 부탁해.","source_cn":"那就有劳了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D9B0211CD7B69FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:20:1